{"id":"663721","name":"脆皮黄油年糕","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/663721/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"90克"},{"name":"淡奶油","amount":"90克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"40～50克"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"150克"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"30克"}],"sub":[{"name":"融化的黄油","amount":"40～50克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"一个鸡蛋+90克牛奶+9克淡奶油。","img":"images/663721/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"～50克糖。","img":"images/663721/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/663721/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入150克糯米粉。","img":"images/663721/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"克面粉。","img":"images/663721/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再次搅拌均匀。","img":"images/663721/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入融化好的黄油40～50克。","img":"images/663721/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再次搅拌均匀，提起打蛋器面糊滴落堆叠感。","img":"images/663721/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"面糊装入裱花袋。","img":"images/663721/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"挤入模具中，8分满(模具提前刷膏状黄油)。","img":"images/663721/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入预热好的烤箱，中层。","img":"images/663721/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"度烤30分钟或200度烤25分钟。","img":"images/663721/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/663721/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"软软糯糯，焦香酥脆。","img":"images/663721/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"超级好吃，喜欢的跟我做起来哦。","img":"images/663721/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}